                "values": [
                  {
                    "editorAlias": "Umbraco.RichText",
                    "culture": null,
                    "segment": null,
                    "alias": "text",
                    "value": {
                      "markup": "<p>Welcome to a small blog with a big theme: the Model Context Protocol. The idea is simple — instead of hand-wiring every tool to every agent, everything speaks one protocol. These posts dig into why that matters.</p>",
